// Loop Transformation Engine: Effect- and MemorySSA-Verified LICM (`opt_licm`),
// Overflow-Faithful Induction Variable Strength Reduction & Address Evolution (`opt_iv_strength_reduce`),
// First-Iteration Loop Peeling (`opt_loop_peel`), Loop Unswitching (`opt_loop_unswitch`),
// Cost-Bounded Full & Partial Loop Unrolling (`opt_loop_unroll`),
// Loop Versioning with Pure Optimization Guards (`opt_loop_version`),
// Adjacent Loop Fusion & Producer-Consumer / Iterator Adapter Buffer Forwarding (`opt_loop_fuse`),
// and Deterministic `--emit=loop-xform` Inspection Formatting (`loop_xform_print`) (T611 / E15.3).
// Implements SPEC-72 §3 (AXS-LOOP-010..017, AXS-LXF-001..008, INV-LOOP-002,
// REQ-OPT-143..147, REQ-OPT-155..175, REQ-OPT-344, REQ-OPT-354).
module compiler.opt.loop_xform

